    "detailed_description": "400 years from now, Earth has perished, and humanity has made its home among the stars. The struggle for a place in space has left a lasting legacy of internal conflicts and brutal faction wars. The galaxy is divided among 10 warring factions, each with its own agenda. Factions like the Children of the Everliving seek eternal life at any cost, while MPL aims for profit, and Tianchao combats corruption with vast spy networks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Abyss</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/ffdd7727e40085c499a52e0b5df0f9b9.poster.avif?t=1737717180\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/ffdd7727e40085c499a52e0b5df0f9b9.webm?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/ffdd7727e40085c499a52e0b5df0f9b9.mp4?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Abyss appeared without warning, causing chaos in the Frontier. As a commander, your ultimate goal is to discover the secrets of the Abyss and prevent it from consuming everything in its path. This exploration-rich game mode lets you choose your path and make crucial command decisions that determine your rewards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes and Challenges</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/f7d7abca1f27af9bc0d31c3b58512028.poster.avif?t=1737717180\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/f7d7abca1f27af9bc0d31c3b58512028.webm?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/f7d7abca1f27af9bc0d31c3b58512028.mp4?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>PvE Content: </strong>Enjoy a story-rich campaign and tackle challenging bounties.<br><strong>PvP Arena:</strong> Test your skills against other players in strategic space battles.<br><strong>The Vault:</strong> Join an alliance and raid the vault for valuable resources.<br><strong>The Abyss:</strong> Uncover secrets and make pivotal decisions in this exploration-focused mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Unique Pilots</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/effba78702cda91dee9fb278bd7f2d07.poster.avif?t=1737717180\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/effba78702cda91dee9fb278bd7f2d07.webm?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/effba78702cda91dee9fb278bd7f2d07.mp4?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Collect over 100 ships, each with unique abilities and backstories. Upgrade your fleet and pilots with powerful enhancements to dominate space.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Customization</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/32f17f780af6bcaa2b6fe75cd9616341.poster.avif?t=1737717180\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/32f17f780af6bcaa2b6fe75cd9616341.webm?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/32f17f780af6bcaa2b6fe75cd9616341.mp4?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Customize your ships with a variety of weapons, shields, and software. Utilize up to 6 gear slots and collect powerful implants for limitless possibilities. Tailor your fleet to your strategic needs and battle preferences.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Tactics<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/ebb6a14733278744e62f3b7583d916f0.poster.avif?t=1737717180\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/ebb6a14733278744e62f3b7583d916f0.webm?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/ebb6a14733278744e62f3b7583d916f0.mp4?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>Use strategic tactics to defeat powerful enemies and progress towards becoming a legendary commander. Plan your moves carefully to create the perfect fleet combination, and choose formations based on your ships\u2019 unique targeting patterns to maximize your battle effectiveness.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limited-Time Events</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/230d32ca5bf91a99e01376bff6882457.poster.avif?t=1737717180\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/230d32ca5bf91a99e01376bff6882457.webm?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/230d32ca5bf91a99e01376bff6882457.mp4?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Engage in exciting events and themed holiday bounties. Participate in community-wide challenges and step into the commander's arcade with mini-games like Gelecek Survivor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Galaxy</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/effba78702cda91dee9fb278bd7f2d07.poster.avif?t=1737717180\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/effba78702cda91dee9fb278bd7f2d07.webm?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021540/extras/effba78702cda91dee9fb278bd7f2d07.mp4?t=1737717180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Starborne: Frontiers, the vast galaxy is your battleground. Use strategy and tactics to navigate through the sci-fi universe, conquering challenges and building your legacy among the stars. Experience the thrill of strategic space battles as you command your fleet in this sci-fi adventure. Master the art of strategy and immerse yourself in a sci-fi epic where your choices shape the fate of the galaxy. Engage in strategic planning and sci-fi battles to become the ultimate commander in Starborne: Frontiers. Strategy is essential in every aspect of this sci-fi universe, and your tactical decisions will determine your success.",
