        ],
        "notes": "Our game features rich and immersive storytelling, which includes mature themes within the backstories of certain units. These narratives may contain depictions of violence, trauma, and other sensitive topics. Specifically, some character histories explore difficult subjects such as:\r\n\r\nViolence: References to physical confrontations and battles are present within the context of the units' past experiences.\r\nTrauma and Psychological Struggles: Characters may have endured various hardships, including the psychological aftermath of war and personal loss.\r\n\r\nIt is important to note that these mature themes are woven into the fabric of the characters' backgrounds to provide depth and realism to their stories. They are not depicted graphically within the gameplay itself. However, players who may have sensitivities to these topics are advised to consider this information before engaging with the game.\r\n\r\nWe believe that these elements contribute to a more compelling and nuanced narrative experience, adding layers of complexity to our characters and their journeys."
    },
